# InventoryMoveItemEvent。ホッパーなどが 1 個ずつ移す直前。

file: net/minecraft/world/level/block/entity/HopperBlockEntity.java
anchor:
    public static ItemStack addItem(@Nullable Container from, Container to, ItemStack stack, @Nullable Direction side) {
insert-after:
